        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibanga ng'uyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, awoowsiina sibanga Israeli gea inyeessa gwaramoorani ng'asheega ateemsheesa saawa nea gabwageat. Eeshiina ‘ooleeysiiniit ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, eamuy daanyaawa sibanga ng'uyeega, gea inyeessa ghwaat geeshta ng'asheega gurooruunatka nyaawa, ak ea mwadaaha eara gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea fuga Israeli sibangeagwa gawuurji fureayoonga neay aba heeda manda sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii gaweay gafur ghamardida nyariin, nea mwadeasa ghamarda nuut, ghoah heechea gafura geat fuga Israeli aba damanda ng'ucheeda aba eaweeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidanyaawa siihiimsa ng'uyeega gil muuchi, nea eara ng'asheega siramoorani ea ng'uyeega gil muuchi. Ak saawa gwayeena ‘gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA,’ nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea mii goojeakta saawa, ak saawa ghwanung' ghwarar buuneeda gideaba ng'asheanda gaygwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gidasiihiimu maba ng'uyeega ak ramoorangeagwa ea mii ng'uyeegea? Nea agooga gooyeenyi ‘gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA,’ nea aniini ea mii dargu eara ng'asheanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Aba gideaba ng'asheegeagwa gea reengaweega nea eara ng'asheegeagwa siihiimu ea ng'uyeega gil muuchi, asi gajeeng'ucheena sea agooga gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydalas uhuuda sibanga rukwiida gisiihiimu bea ng'uyyeega, nea gwaramoorani ng'asheega reengaweega. Nea inyas ghabwatgeat fugeasu aba hijagi, saawa maygwanda jeeda, nea maygwanda jeeda mooneeda fuga Israeli. Ak ea maygaweay jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli, ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibanga gahuteawi fugeasu nea gwayeeniisa, ‘Gwanda hoyyoo’ nea hoyyoo ea mandana. Fugeasu ghwadeas ghamarda, ak saawa ghwayeasha roonghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eeshiina sibang'su yeasha ghamarda roonghoodean, gideaba gayghwahidu roopta haw bea lagheanga ea siilakghta. Ak gayghabwaay ghamardida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama abeada ghamardida, ea mayghoanyaasheagwa buuneeda gideaba ‘gwanda yeenu roonghooda ghayi oayeashchi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, abeeda nyarasteanyu gaydanung' ghwahidu jeameeda eadu siilakghta, ea roopta haw bea lagheanga, ak gayghwanung' ghoabeada ghamardida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ea gichea danyarjeawda ghamarda eayeashi roonghooda miyeeng'waal muuchi gil, ak gaydajaksa ng'eanyi ak ghwadaajiit sindeetaanyi ak gayghoabeada. Ak gajealas uhuudeang'wa aba bugustaanyi, ak gajanala gideaba aniini geewooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi nyarasteanyu sean gaydanung' gooshealsa uhuudeaba ghamari ea uhuudeaba fiisu yeasha roonghoodean. Ak gajeeyeeshiineegwa, ghamarda mutgwanda nea eara fuga yeasha oormeeda ea mutgwanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Was sibanga Israeli ramoorani ng'asheega Yerusalemu, nea ghwadaah gisiihiimu bea hoyyoo aba ng'asheagaaschi nea manda hoyyoo, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badayda sibanga was gadeemga bea ng'uyyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ang'iing'i orjeeda siida, yamsiina geaw fugaagu, gea ramoorani ng'asheega beachi fughareenga nyaawa nea gabwageat. Ak giramoorsi saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeshiina gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, dasheagiida gadeemga ratiisa muhookajeega damealga sean bea geatinga nea ghwayiin weageaka iheenga buuneeda nea abeeda gagaseada gurooruunatka buuneeda heapi? Gajagasa gurooruunatka fugeasu nea goonung' ghaghu gurooruunatkeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea agooga ea noang'udanaan ririnnyeanda aba bugusta fugeasu. Aba baneagagi bea nganooyda siguura shayiiri ea banajanga mukaate, aba gideaba ghoadeal gurooruunatka fuga mamiisiina miyeeda ak ghaghamwat goobiida gurooruunatka fuga mamiisiina giibinda ng'eanyiida aba gideaba gwareengani fugeasu aleeysiit ng'asheega ng'uyeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Ng'ula, aniini mwaamwasi muhookajeegeagwa, aba gideaba suh gooshageadawi gurooruunatka buuneeda gawuurji dariidaka. Ak gaydageandeawa geatingeagwa aba uurda ak gaydasiksa gurooruunatkiga ooweayi shageata gawuurji dariidakean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydabwaashaada weageakeagwa, nea ghaaghuuyi fugeasu aba geatingeagwa, ak ea may gudeeshageat aba geatingeagwa, ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba agooga noanung' ghwanyareas guroorooda siida doabiiwaat aba ng'uyeega. Nea aniini ea mii danung' ghang'ut gurmeahiida ak ghana goomajeekchi geatinga siida muy ak ea mwayamwa geaw nea mwanung'waada naweadingaaschi munyas ak ghoaghu eaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba badaydeaba nih, agooga maygudaada ng'asheega munyas. Ghana ramooranga ng'asheega ak gaydaaghu fugeasu aba geatingeagwa, ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
